        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "-Delightful 2 Bedroomed Mid-Terraced Home\r\n\r\n-Scope For A Further Bedroom In Attic\r\n\r\n-Spacious Back Garden\r\n\r\n-Convenient To Every Amenity Imaginable\r\n\r\n-Situated Accross From A Large Mature Green Space\r\n\r\n\r\nPremium Collection are proud to present this wonderful two bedroom two bathroom mid-terraced home located opposite a large green space amenity in the heart of the much sought after Charlesland development.\r\n\r\nOffering further scope for extension into the attic as others in this community have done this property will appeal to many different market segments including first time buyers and investors alike.\r\n\r\nThe ground level consists of an entrance porch leading into an open plan kitchen/dining room comprising shaker style kitchen cabinetry, ample countertop space, integrated appliances and tile floors. To the rear there is a large light and bright living room with gas fireplace which leads through two large wood framed glass patio doors into a good size rear garden. This level is completed by a spacious downstairs bathroom. \r\n\r\nUpstairs there are two spacious bedrooms both with fitted wardrobes with the master bedroom looking out over a large greenspace area. The main bathroom comprises a bath/shower combination and is finished with floor to ceiling tile.\r\n\r\nThe community of Charleland is a wonderfully maintained mature development with an abundance of amenities including numerous open green space areas, mature trees, planting areas and children’s playground and this residence is within easy walking distance of the modern neighbourhood shopping centre which includes a large Supervalu supermarket, a pharmacy, hair & beauty salon, gym and yoga studio.\r\n\r\nIdeally located close to the prestigious Greystones village this home is perfectly positioned to avail of the many sporting and leisure amenities available nearby including golf, rugby, tennis water sports, GAA and football and it’s only a short cycle from Greystones Marina and the Shoreline Leisure Centre and swimming pool.\r\n\r\nNestled between the mountains and the sea Charlesland also provides an excellent choice of primary and secondary schools and is only a short distance from Greystones DART station as well as numerous public and private transport routes including the N11 linking with the M50 to the airport.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
